7.31566606103428,\"foundWords\":[\"inter\",\"inter-core\",\"core\"],\"matches\":[],\"excerpt\":\"# A.4 Installation\\n(1) Start by downloading the Elk artifact from GitHub:\\n```\\ngit clone https://github.com/platformxlab/elk.git\\ncd elk\\n```\\n(2) Please make sure all prerequisites are successfully installed:\\n```\\nsudo add-apt-repository ppa:deadsnakes/ppa\\nsudo apt update\\nsudo apt install python3.10\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_2025/12-ELK- Exploring the Efficiency of Inter-core Connected AI Chips with Deep Learning Compiler Techniques/A.3-Description.md\",\"basename\":\"A.3-Description\",\"score\":227.31566606103428,\"foundWords\":[\"inter\",\"inter-core\",\"core\"],\"matches\":[],\"excerpt\":\"# A.3 Description\\nA.3.1 How to Access. The source code can be downloaded from Zenodo at [https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16541972.](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16541972) For the latest version, you can access our GitHub repository: [https://github.com/](https://github.com/platformxlab/elk.git) [p\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_2025/12-ELK- Exploring the Efficiency of Inter-core Connected AI Chips with Deep Learning Compiler Techniques/A.2-Artifact-Checklist-Meta-Information.md\",\"basename\":\"A.2-Artifact-Checklist-Meta-Information\",\"score\":227.31566606103428,\"foundWords\":[\"inter\",\"inter-core\",\"core\"],\"matches\":[],\"excerpt\":\"# A.2 Artifact Checklist (Meta-Information)\\n- Algorithm: Inductive tensor operator scheduling, cost-aware on-chip memory allocation, and ICCA chip design space exploration.\\n- Neural Network Models: Llama2-13B, Gemma2-27B, OPT-30B, Llama2- 70B, and DiT-XL. Their execution graphs are included in the\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_2025/12-ELK- Exploring the Efficiency of Inter-core Connected AI Chips with Deep Learning Compiler Techniques/A.1-Abstract.md\",\"basename\":\"A.1-Abstract\",\"score\":227.31566606103428,\"foundWords\":[\"inter\",\"inter-core\",\"core\"],\"matches\":[],\"excerpt\":\"# A.1 Abstract\\nIn this artifact, we provide the source code of Elk's compilation, simulation, and evaluation framework. Then, we guide readers to explore how Elk improves the model serving performance on a variety of ICCA chips (i.e., Figure 17-24 in this paper). To run this artifact, please use a\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_2025/12-ELK- Exploring the Efficiency of Inter-core Connected AI Chips with Deep Learning Compiler Techniques/9-Conclusion.md\",\"basename\":\"9-Conclusion\",\"score\":227.31566606103428,\"foundWords\":[\"inter\",\"inter-core\",\"core\"],\"matches\":[],\"excerpt\":\"# 9 Conclusion\\nWe study the performance trade-offs of generic ICCA chips that support off-chip memory, and develop a DL compiler framework Elk to explore the efficiency of ICCA chips. Elk also enables design space exploration of ICCA chip architecture. We demonstrate the capability of Elk using bot\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_moe/C3PO Critical-Layer, Core-Expert, Collaborative Pathway Optimization for Test-Time Expert Re-Mixing/2-Related-Work.md\",\"basename\":\"2-Related-Work\",\"score\":194.34482820752726,\"foundWords\":[\"interpolating\",\"core\",\"core-expert,\",\"core-expert\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Core-Expert,\",\"offset\":3598},{\"match\":\"interpolating\",\"offset\":6295},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":8304},{\"match\":\"Core\",\"offset\":10412},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":11677},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":11993},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":12139},{\"match\":\"core\",\"offset\":12492}],\"excerpt\":\"To address this limitation, Critical-Layer, Core-Expert, Collaborative Pathway Optimization (C3PO) introduces a dynamic test-time re-mixing mechanism that adapts the pathway matrices for each test sample based on similar samples in a **reference set**—a collection of samples on which the MoE LLM's outputs are correct or preferred. Specificall…\"},{\"filename\":\"paper_secs/secs_moe/Exploiting Inter-Layer Expert Affinity for Accelerating Mixture-of-Experts Model I