-MOE-TRAINING.md","basename":"span-idpage-5-0span5-MEGABLOCKS-A-FRAMEWORK-FOR-EFFICIENT-MOE-TRAINING","score":376.93908138598715,"foundWords":["mega","megablocks.","megablocks,","megablocks:","megablocks","megatron-lm.","megatron-lm's","megatron-lm,","megatron-lm","megatron","kernel","kernel.","kernels.","kernels,","kernels"],"matches":[{"match":"MEGABLOCKS:","offset":31},{"match":"MegaBlocks,","offset":132},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":160},{"match":"kernels,","offset":480},{"match":"kernels.","offset":606},{"match":"kernels","offset":1182},{"match":"Kernels","offset":1565},{"match":"kernels","offset":1615},{"match":"kernels","offset":3838},{"match":"kernels.","offset":3987},{"match":"kernels","offset":4475},{"match":"kernels,","offset":5916},{"match":"kernel","offset":6782},{"match":"MegaBlocks.","offset":7771},{"match":"kernels","offset":10826},{"match":"kernels","offset":10972},{"match":"kernels.","offset":11224},{"match":"kernel.","offset":11723},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":13754},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":13978},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":14577},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":14835},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":15402},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":15587},{"match":"Megatron-LM.","offset":15874},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":16010},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":16044},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":16090},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":16614},{"match":"kernels","offset":17000},{"match":"kernels","offset":17486},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":18121},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":18154},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":18260},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":20063},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":20250},{"match":"kernels","offset":20694},{"match":"Megatron-LM,","offset":20923},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":20955},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":21169},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":21410},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":21577},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":22667},{"match":"kernels","offset":23443},{"match":"kernels,","offset":23943},{"match":"kernels","offset":24911},{"match":"kernels","offset":25085}],"excerpt":"# <span id=\"page-5-0\"></span>5 MEGABLOCKS: A FRAMEWORK FOR EFFICIENT MOE TRAINING\nWe implemented our techniques in a system called MegaBlocks, which builds on Megatron-LM (Shoeybi et al., 2019) and PyTorch (Paszke et al., 2019). In addition to high-performance dMoE layers, our system supports distributed training of MoEs with bo…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/8-Conclusion.md","basename":"8-Conclusion","score":334.3674058373718,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kernel.","mega-kernelizing","mega-kernel","kernel","kernelizing","kernel-launch","kernel-per-operator"],"matches":[{"match":"mega-kernel.","offset":154},{"match":"kernel","offset":213},{"match":"kernel-per-operator","offset":283},{"match":"kernel-launch","offset":433},{"match":"mega-kernel","offset":675}],"excerpt":"…piler and runtime system that automatically transforms multi-GPU model inference into a fully fused mega-kernel. By introducing SM-level task graphs and an in-kernel parallel runtime, MPK overcomes fundamental limitations of the kernel-per-operator model, enabling inter-operator software pipelining, fine-grained overlap of computation and communication, and the elimination of kernel-launch and CPU…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/6-Evaluation.md","basename":"6-Evaluation","score":325.6014298446664,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kernelizing","mega-kernel","kernel","kernelizing","kernel-peroperator","kernel-per-operator"],"matches":[{"match":"mega-kernel","offset":118},{"match":"kernel-per-operator","offset":168},{"match":"kernel-peroperator","offset":556},{"match":"mega-kernel","offset":750}],"excerpt":"…is section evaluates MPK by answering three key questions. First, § [6.3](#page-9-0) compares MPK's mega-kernel execution model with state-of-the-art kernel-per-operator systems. Second, § [6.5](#page-11-0) examines MPK's scalability and efficiency in multi-GPU execution for large-scale DNN workloads. Finally, § [6.6](#page-11-1) analyzes how the individual optimizations in MPK contribute to the o…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/span-idpage-7-1span5.3-Runtime-Optimizations.md","basename":"span-idpage-7-1span5.3-Runtime-Optimizations","score":309.5622732058988,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kernelizing","mega-kernel","kernel","kernelizing","kernel-per-operator"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel","offset":381},{"match":"kernel","offset":397},{"match":"kernel-per-operator","offset":474},{"match":"kernel","offset":509},{"match":"mega-kernel","offset":1633}],"excerpt":"…n-chip memory that is private to each thread block. Shared memory exists only for the lifetime of a kernel once the kernel finishes, its shared memory is automatically released. In the current kernel-per-operator approach, each kernel assumes *exclusive* access to the entire shared memory to comply with this programming model. However, this design prevents cross-task software pipelining (§ [2\\)](#…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/span-idpage-1-1span2.1-GPU-Programming-Model.md","basename":"span-idpage-1-1span2.1-GPU-Programming-Model","score":299.2786726422029,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kernelizing","kernel","kernelizing","kernel,","kernels,","kernels","*kernel"],"matches":[{"match":"*kernel","offset":95},{"match":"kernel","offset":228},{"match":"Kernel","offset":526},{"match":"kernel","offset":925},{"match":"kernel,","offset":1084},{"match":"*kernel","offset":1303},{"match":"kernels","offset":1394},{"match":"kernel","offset":1438},{"match":"kernel","offset":1540},{"match":"kernel","offset":1584},{"match":"kernel","offset":2467},{"match":"Kernel","offset":2700},{"match":"kernel","offset":2951},{"match":"kernel","offset":3075},{"match":"Kernel","offset":3091},{"match":"kernels","offset":3146},{"match":"kernels","offset":3289},{"match":"kernels,","offset":3535},{"match":"kernel","offset":3589},{"match":"kernel","offset":3652},{"match":"kernel","offset":3938},{"match":"kernel","offset":4326},{"match":"kernel","offset":4421}],"excerpt":"On GPUs, computations are organized as *kernels*, each representing a function executed concurrently across many cores in a single-program, multiple-data (SPMD) fashion. A kernel consists of a grid of *thread blocks*, where each block is assigned to a streaming multiprocessor (SM) and contains multiple *threads* that operate on individua…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/References.md","basename":"References","score":298.80155549026654,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kernelizing","megakernel","megatron-lm:","megatron-lm","megatron","kernel","kernelizing","kernel.","kernel,"],"matches":[{"match":"Kernel.","offset":1783},{"match":"kernel","offset":1892},{"match":"Megakernel","offset":1982},{"match":"kernel,","offset":3545},{"match":"kernel","offset":5844},{"match":"Megatron-lm:","offset":7848}],"excerpt":"…span id=\"page-12-7\"></span>[8] Accelerating MoE's with a Triton Persistent Cache-Aware Grouped GEMM Kernel. [Link,](https://pytorch.org/blog/accelerating-moes-with-a-triton-persistent-cache-aware-grouped-gemm-kernel/) 2025. [11](#page-10-1)\n- <span id=\"page-12-3\"></span>[9] Designing a Low-Latency Megakernel for Llama-1B. [https://hazyresearch.stanford.edu/blog/](https://hazyresearch.stanford.edu/…"},{"filename":"paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Mirage Persistent Kernel A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs/4.2-Task-Implementation-Generation.md","basename":"4.2-Task-Implementation-Generation","score":276.3352944616659,"foundWords":["mega","mega-kern