"tokens\",\"offset\":1851},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1879},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1983},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":2316},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":2357},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":2415},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":2495},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":2595},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":2648},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":3034}],\"excerpt\":\"## All-to-All Communication in MoE Training\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nAll-to-All 通信是 MoE 分布式训练中 expert parallelism 的核心通信原语。在 MoE 层中，每个 GPU 上的 tokens 经过 gating network 路由后，需要被发送到存有所选 expert 参数的 GPU 上进行计算。由于 expert 分布在所有 GPU 上，任意 GPU 都可能需要向任意其他 GPU 发送 tokens，形成 All-to-All 通信模式。具体分为两个阶段…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/2DH (Two-Dimensional Hierarchical) All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）.md\",\"basename\":\"2DH (Two-Dimensional Hierarchical) All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）\",\"score\":1240.219175638828,\"foundWords\":[\"all\",\"all2all_2dh\",\"all2all\",\"alltoall\",\"all-to-all（n/m\",\"all-to-all（m\",\"all-to-all（二维层次化全交换）\",\"all-to-all:\",\"all-to-all\",\"to\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）\",\"offset\":38},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":109},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":162},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":217},{\"match\":\"All-to-All（m\",\"offset\":423},{\"match\":\"All-to-All（n/m\",\"offset\":507},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":554},{\"match\":\"All-to-All:\",\"offset\":610},{\"match\":\"ALL2ALL_2DH\",\"offset\":650},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1063},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":1579},{\"match\":\"`alltoa\",\"offset\":2518},{\"match\":\"r All-to-A\",\"offset\":2687}],\"excerpt\":\"## 2DH (Two-Dimensional Hierarchical) All-to-All（二维层次化全交换）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n2DH All-to-All 是 TUTEL 提出的新型 All-to-All 通信算法，解决标准 Linear All-to-All 在大规模 GPU 集群中因消息大小 S/n 过小而无法饱和网络带宽的问题。核心思想：将 All-to-All 分解为节点内（intra-node）和节点间（inter-node）两个层次，通过 stride memory copy 将非连续的小 chunks 聚合为大 chunks，在大规模下保持高链路利用率。2DH 算法包含…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/DeepSpeed-Inference (Microsoft 推理优化框架).md\",\"basename\":\"DeepSpeed-Inference (Microsoft 推理优化框架)\",\"score\":1219.1903869258576,\"foundWords\":[\"expert\",\"expert_parallel_alltoall\",\"expert_out\",\"experts\",\"parallelism\",\"parallelism**：为推理场景优化\",\"moe\",\"all-to-all\",\"fusion\",\"fusion**：将多个小\",\"fusion、量化推理等功能。bigmac\",\"kernel\",\"kernels\",\"kernel，减少\",\"kernel（如\",\"all\",\"alltoall_gather\",\"alltoall\",\"allocation\",\"to\",\"top8,\",\"top8\",\"tokens\",\"token\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":113},{\"match\":\"fusion、量化推理等功能。BigMac\",\"offset\":120},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":289},{\"match\":\"Fusion**：将多个小\",\"offset\":296},{\"match\":\"kernel（如\",\"offset\":310},{\"match\":\"kernel，减少\",\"offset\":365},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":375},{\"match\":\"Parallelism**：为推理场景优化\",\"offset\":422},{\"match\":\"expert\",\"offset\":460},{\"match\":\"parallelism\",\"offset\":467},{\"match\":\"Top8,\",\"offset\":606},{\"match\":\"Top8,\",\"offset\":649},{\"match\":\"MoE\",\"offset\":763},{\"match\":\"All-to-All\",\"offset\":767},{\"match\":\"to\",\"offset\":869},{\"match\":\"allocation\",\"offset\":939},{\"match\":\"parallelism\",\"offset\":1041},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1070},{\"match\":\"kernels\",\"offset\":1097},{\"match\":\"tokens\",\"offset\":1152},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1201},{\"match\":\"MoE\",\"offset\":1276},{\"match\":\"token\",\"offset\":1357},{\"match\":\"expert_parallel_alltoal\",\"offset\":1366},{\"match\":\"expert_ou\",\"offset\":1422},{\"match\":\"_expert\",\"offset\":1443},{\"match\":\"(token\",\"offset\":1451},{\"match\":\"exper\",\"offset\":1473},{\"match\":\"alltoall_gathe\",\"offset\":1499},{\"match\":\"(expert_ou\",\"offset\":1515},{\"match\":\"st\",\"offset\":1581},{\"match\":\"toke\",\"offset\":1640},{\"match\":\"kerne\",\"offset\":1876},{\"match\":\"-Expert\",\"offset\":1