{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_aFLYYzYkxjXXwDJ1y8dZ3579","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS).md\",\"basename\":\"Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS)\",\"score\":562.6096259951605,\"foundWords\":[\"multilingual），各继续训练\",\"multilingual\",\"branch\",\"branch-train-stitch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Branch-Train-Stitch\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Branch\",\"offset\":307},{\"match\":\"Multilingual\",\"offset\":429},{\"match\":\"Multilingual），各继续训练\",\"offset\":952}],\"excerpt\":\"## Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS)\\n术语解释\\nBTS 是由 Qizhen Zhang et al. (Meta, 2025) 提出的三阶段训练算法，将多个独立训练的领域专用 LLM Expert 合并为一个通用（generalist）模型。BTS 在保持 Expert 参数完全冻结的前提下，通过插入并训练轻量 Stitch Layer（264M 参数 vs 总 11B 参数）建立 Expert 之间的可学习连接，实现比 Expert Upcycling 和 Expert Merging baseline 更好的平均下游任务性能。\\n术语是什么？\\nBTS 算法包含三个阶段：\\n1…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Stream GPU Execution.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Stream GPU Execution\",\"score\":491.3458280233232,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiplexing）\",\"multiplexing\",\"multi-head\",\"multi-stream\",\"branch\",\"branch_b_subgraph_1\",\"branch_b_subgraph_0\",\"branch_a_subgraph_1\",\"branch_a_subgraph_0\",\"branch_5:\",\"branch_4:\",\"branch_3:\",\"branch_2:\",\"branch_1:\",\"branch_0:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-Stream\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Multi-Stream\",\"offset\":75},{\"match\":\"multi-stream\",\"offset\":452},{\"match\":\"multi-head\",\"offset\":525},{\"match\":\"multi-stream\",\"offset\":712},{\"match\":\"branch_0:\",\"offset\":814},{\"match\":\"branch_1:\",\"offset\":864},{\"match\":\"branch_2:\",\"offset\":914},{\"match\":\"branch_3:\",\"offset\":964},{\"match\":\"branch_4:\",\"offset\":1014},{\"match\":\"branch_5:\",\"offset\":1064},{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":1128},{\"match\":\"Multi-stream\",\"offset\":2094},{\"match\":\"multiplexing）\",\"offset\":2554},{\"match\":\"branch_A_subgraph_0\",\"offset\":2642},{\"match\":\"branch_A_subgraph_1\",\"offset\":2664},{\"match\":\"branch_B_subgraph_0\",\"offset\":2707},{\"match\":\"branch_B_subgraph_1\",\"offset\":2729}],\"excerpt\":\"## Multi-Stream GPU Execution\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMulti-Stream GPU Execution（多流GPU执行）是将 GPU 计算任务（kernel launches）分配到多个 CUDA stream 上并行执行的技术。每个 CUDA stream 是一个 FIFO 命令队列，同一 stream 内的操作按序执行，不同 stream 间的操作可以在 GPU 上真正并发执行——前提是硬件资源（SM 数量、shared memory、register file）允许多个 kernel 同时驻留。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Batched Preprocessing Kernels (Jagged Tensor Operations for Recommendation).md\",\"basename\":\"Batched Preprocessing Kernels (Jagged Tensor Operations for Recommendation)\",\"score\":46.63694259507257,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-feature\",\"branch\",\"branch-free\",\"branchless\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branch-free\",\"offset\":1590},{\"match\":\"Multi-feature\",\"offset\":1690},{\"match\":\"branchless\",\"offset\":2317}],\"excerpt\":\"// For 3-10 element border arrays: O(n) > O(log n) due to branch-free + no CF overhead\\n  \\nMTIA v2i: 2.94-9.25×; v3: 2.31-3.09×\\n```\\n**Batch Event Truncate** (Multi-feature parallel):\\n```\\nPyTorch: per-feature sequential loop (no batched variant existed)\\nKernelEvolve batched Triton: all features in parallel, single launch\\n  No truncation needed: 9.8-14.5× (…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/SwiGLU FFN.md\",\"basename\":\"SwiGLU FFN\",\"score\":37.759101641042086,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multiply\",\"multiplicative\",\"multi-head\",\"branch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Gate b\",\"offset\":882},{\"match\":\": Up b\",\"offset\":1092},{\"match\":\"wise mul\",\"offset\":1241},{\"match\":\"wise multiplic\",\"offset\":1859},{\"match\":\"ent-wise\",\"offset\":2335},{\"match\":\"+ SiLU +\",\"offset\":2437},{\"match\":\"sion——通过 m\",\"offset\":2634},{\"match\":\"题：\\n- Flash\",\"offset\":2897}],\"excerpt\":\"# Step 1: Gate branch — 计算 gating signal\\n    gate_logits = X @ W_gate.T        # [L, d_model] × [d_model, d_ff] → [L, d_ff]\\n    gate = F.silu(gate_logits)        # SiLU(x) = x * sigmoid(x), element-wise\\n    \\n    # Step 2: Up branch — 计算 value stream\\n    up = X @ W_up.T                   # [L, d_model] × [d_mo…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Group GEMM for MoE Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Group GEMM for MoE Inference\",\"score\":37.5934668944458,\"foundWords\":[\"multiplication）是moe推理中将多个expert的矩阵乘法合并到单个统一kernel\",\"multiplication\",\"multimodal\",\"branch\",\"branch-free\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multiplication）是MoE推理中将多个expert的矩阵乘法合并到单个统一kernel\",\"offset\":74},{\"match\":\"Branch-free\",\"offset\":757},{\"match\":\"ts Multimo\",\"offset\":2118}],\"excerpt\":\"Group GEMM（Grouped General Matrix Multiplication）是MoE推理中将多个expert的矩阵乘法合并到单个统一kernel launch中并发执行的技术。每个expert的输入token batch被分配为group内的一个独立子任务（sub-task），所有子任务在同一kernel grid内并行执行。核心优势：(1) 减少kernel launch次数——所有active experts的FFN计算在单次kernel launch中完成；(2) 自然适应动态expert activation pattern——不同token激活不同expert集合，group内子任务数动态变化；(3) 通过offline pro…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/GEMM-based Operator Chain (FFN_Gated FFN_Conv Chain) as Compute-Intensive Fusion Target（作为计算密集融合目标的G.md\",\"basename\":\"GEMM-based Operator Chain (FFN_Gated FFN_Conv Chain) as Compute-Intensive Fusion Target（作为计算密集融合目标的G\",\"score\":33.11493074420969,\"foundWords\":[\"multiply\",\"multiplication\",\"branch\",\"branch:\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multiplication\",\"offset\":193},{\"match\":\"branch:\",\"offset\":1215},{\"match\":\"branch:\",\"offset\":1279},{\"match\":\"multiply\",\"offset\":1371}],\"excerpt\":\"GEMM-based Operator Chain 是 LLM 和 CNN 中由连续 General Matrix Multiplication (GEMM) 构成的算子序列，在 FlashFuser 论文中是 kernel fusion 的主要目标。三种典型模式：(1) Standard FFN——两个连续 GEMM（GEMM(A,B)→C → activation(如ReLU) → GEMM(C,D)→E），如 GPT/OPT/LLaMA 的 Feed-Forward Network 层；(2) Gated FFN——FFN 带两个平行的 Up-FFN 分支（SwiGLU 结构），其中一个分支经 SiLU 激活后与另一分支 element-wise 乘再进入后续 GEMM；(3) Conv Chain—…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Structured State Space Duality (SSD) _ Mamba2.md\",\"basename\":\"Structured State Space Duality (SSD) _ Mamba2\",\"score\":32.56583436125261,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-input\",\"multi-head\",\"branch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Multi-input\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"Multi-Head\",\"offset\":303},{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":1386}],\"excerpt\":\"…*选择性 SSM 与线性注意力在数学上的对偶关系**——两者都通过半可分矩阵（semiseparable matrix）表达序列变换，仅是同一矩阵的两种分解视角。Mamba2 的核心改进：(1) **Multi-input SSM**：引入 head 结构（类似 Multi-Head Attention），$B_t, C_t$ 在 channel 间共享（类比 grouped-query attention），state group size 可配（默认为 8 组，每组 128 channel）；(2) **简化 block 设计**：$x_t, B_t, C_t, \\\\Delta_t$ 由单次投影并行生成 $(x_t, B_t, C_t, \\\\Delta_t) = F(u_t)$，消除 Mamba1 的 sequential linear，使 tensor parallelism 仅需 1…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Query Typology_ Global Query vs Localized Query.md\",\"basename\":\"Query Typology_ Global Query vs Localized Query\",\"score\":31.617751822969023,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-detail→lq\",\"branch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":661},{\"match\":\"Branch\",\"offset\":776},{\"match\":\"multi-detail→LQ\",\"offset\":1482}],\"excerpt\":\"…推断视频风格 → 识别 referents → 综合判断）输出 isGlobal: true/false。LQ accuracy >90%，GQ accuracy 38-75%（误分类代价低，走错 branch 最多增加计算开销）。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，比如术语所在pipeline的伪代码或具体计算过程，给出具体例子。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\n```\\n# Query Classification + Branch Routing\\nclassification = LLM_classify(Q)  # CoT prompt\\nif classification.isGlobal:\\n    frames = uniform_sample(V, N)  # 高效路径\\nelse:\\n    r_frames = CAFS(V)             # 精准路径\\n    r…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/dsm_comm Primitive（DSM通信原语）.md\",\"basename\":\"dsm_comm Primitive（DSM通信原语）\",\"score\":29.534540022546445,\"foundWords\":[\"multiply。\",\"multiply\",\"branch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":1679},{\"match\":\"multiply。\",\"offset\":1840}],\"excerpt\":\"Gated FFN 变体：(1) spatial partitioning (clsk=2, 两 GEM