nching，与SIMT模型冲突导致warp\",\"offset\":2109},{\"match\":\"branching\",\"offset\":2262},{\"match\":\"multipliers\",\"offset\":2500},{\"match\":\"multipliers\",\"offset\":2639}],\"excerpt\":\"GPU vs Hardware对比：GPU上早期退出需要global synchronization和conditional branching，与SIMT模型冲突导致warp divergence和underutilization。WTU专用硬件通过bucket sorters（upper + lower）和adder tree流水线化处理，无需synchronization，bitmask-based selection消除branching overhead。消融实验：AGX+ReSV (GPU)上KV prediction占48% latency → +KVPU (hardware)降至0.5%，其中WTU early-exit sorting贡献了significant reduction。\\n术语一般如何…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (专家并行).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Parallelism (专家并行)\",\"score\":17.3060826904172,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"branching\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branchin\",\"offset\":2601},{\"match\":\"e multi-chipl\",\"offset\":4338}],\"excerpt\":\"- **Hierarchical MoE 与设备的协同设计**：第一级 Gate 的 branching factor = GPU 数量 → 主 Gate 选择 GPU (group) → 次级 Gate 在 GPU 本地选 expert → 次级 expert 间无跨设备通信。\\n- **与后续 EP 的关系**：该方法奠定了 Expert Parallelism 的基本设计原则——dense 部分用 DP，sparse 部分用 MP/EP。该论文尚未使用 AlltoAll 通信（因 Hierarchical MoE 避免了次级通信），后续 GShard (Lepikhin et al. 2020) 在 flat MoE 中引入 AlltoAll 通信，成为现代 EP 的标准…\"}],\"totalCount\":13,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"horizontal fusion attention head multi-branch path:knowledge_notes\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f212e3b-c891-4491-ad1a-d065a46eb6c1","uuid":"c80d39a6-bcd3-4e2a-9547-24d1c1bd013c","timestamp":"2026-05-30T20:05:26.388Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS).md\",\"basename\":\"Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS)\",\"score\":562.6096259951605,\"foundWords\":[\"multilingual），各继续训练\",\"multilingual\",\"branch\",\"branch-train-stitch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Branch-Train-Stitch\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Branch\",\"offset\":307},{\"match\":\"Multilingual\",\"offset\":429},{\"match\":\"Multilingual），各