tch\":\"Multimodal\",\"offset\":1624}],\"excerpt\":\"- DMT 决策在 router kernel 内部实现：计算 importance score 后，使用 branch-free masked comparison 与 modality-specific threshold 比较，不引入额外 kernel launch。\\n- 仅适用于 MLLM（同时处理 text + vision token）。对于 text-only LLM，只需单一阈值（退化为 Thresholding baseline）。\\n涉及论文标题：\\n- MoDES: Accelerating Mixture-of-Experts Multimodal Large Language Models via Dynamic Expert Skipping\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/DSP Packing for BF16（BF16双乘法DSP打包）.md\",\"basename\":\"DSP Packing for BF16（BF16双乘法DSP打包）\",\"score\":21.618703214848566,\"foundWords\":[\"multiply\",\"branch\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":622},{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":721},{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":772},{\"match\":\"multiply\",\"offset\":867},{\"match\":\"branch\",\"offset\":1026}],\"excerpt\":\"// 约束: B操作数相同（在multi-branch drafting中自然满足）\\n// PE内使用:\\nfor each PE in systolic array:\\n    A1 = weight_buffer_1[addr]  // branch 1 weight\\n    A2 = weight_buffer_2[addr]  // branch 2 weight\\n    B  = activation[addr]       // shared activation\\n    (P1, P2) = DSP.packed_multiply(A1, A2, B)\\n    acc1 += BF16_assemble(A1.sign,…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Early-Exit Sorting（提前退出排序）.md\",\"basename\":\"Early-Exit Sorting（提前退出排序）\",\"score\":21.207163030507488,\"foundWords\":[\"multipliers\",\"branching，与simt模型冲突导致warp\",\"branching\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branching，与SIMT模型冲突导致warp\",\"offset\":2109},{\"match\":\"branching\",\"offset\":2262},{\"match\":\"multipliers\",\"offset\":2500},{\"match\":\"multipliers\",\"offset\":2639}],\"excerpt\":\"GPU vs Hardware对比：GPU上早期退出需要global synchronization和conditional branching，与SIMT模型冲突导致warp divergence和underutilization。WTU专用硬件通过bucket sorters（upper + lower）和adder tree流水线化处理，无需synchronization，bitmask-based selection消除branching overhead。消融实验：AGX+ReSV (GPU)上KV prediction占48% latency → +KVPU (hardware)降至0.5%，其中WTU early-exit sorting贡献了significant reduction。\\n术语一般如何…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism (专家并行).md\",\"basename\":\"Expert Parallelism (专家并行)\",\"score\":17.3060826904172,\"foundWords\":[\"multi\",\"multi-chiplet\",\"branching\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"branchin\",\"offset\":2601},{\"match\":\"e multi-chipl\",\"offset\":4338}],\"excerpt\":\"- **Hierarchical MoE 与设备的协同设计**：第一级 Gate 的 branching factor = GPU 数量 → 主 Gate 选择 GPU (group) → 次级 Gate 在 GPU 本地选 expert → 次级 expert 间无跨设备通信。\\n- **与后续 EP 的关系**：该方法奠定了 Expert Parallelism 的基本设计原则——dense 部分用 DP，sparse 部分用 MP/EP。该论文尚未使用 AlltoAll 通信（因 Hierarchical MoE 避免了次级通信），后续 GShard (Lepikhin et al. 2020) 在 flat MoE 中引入 AlltoAll 通信，成为现代 EP 的标准…\"}],\"totalCount\":13,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"horizontal fusion attention head multi-branch path:knowledge_notes\"}","structuredContent":{"result":{"mode":"omnisearch","hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS).md","basename":"Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS)","score":562.6096259951605,"foundWords":["multilingual），各继续训练","multilingual","branch","branch-train-stitch"],"matches":[{"match":"Branch-Train-Stitch","offset":3},{"match":"Branch","offset":307},{"match":"Multilingual","offset":429},{"match":"Multilingual），各继续训练","offset":952}],"excerpt":"## Branch-Train-Stitch (BTS)\n术语解释\nBTS 是由 Qizhen Zhang et al. (Meta, 2025) 提出的三阶段训练算法，将多个独立训练的领域专用 LLM Expert 合并为一个通用（generalist）模型。BTS 在保持 Expert 参数完全冻结的前提下，通过插入并训练轻量 Stitch Layer（264M 参数 vs 总 11B 参数）建立 Expert 之间的可学习连接，实现比 Expert Upcycling 和 Expert Merging baseline 更好的平均下游任务性能。\n术语是什么？\nBTS 算法包含三个阶段：\n1…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Multi-Stream GPU Execution.md","basename":"Multi-Stream GPU Execution","score":491.3458280233232,"foundWords":["multi","multiplexing）","multiplexing","multi-head","multi-stream","branch","branch_b_subgraph_1","branch_b_subgraph_0","branch_a_subgraph_1","branch_a_subgraph_0","branch_5:","branch_4:","branch_3:","branch_2:","branch_1:","branch_0:"],"matches":[{"match":"Multi-Stream","offset":3},{"match":"Multi-Stream","offset":75}