"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":766},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":834},{\"match\":\"blocks分配\",\"offset\":854},{\"match\":\"block含4\",\"offset\":875},{\"match\":\"block数\",\"offset\":948},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":966},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":982},{\"match\":\"blocks_per_warp\",\"offset\":1004},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":1033},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1107},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1142},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1156},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1184},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1200},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1211},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1245},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":1272},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":1488},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":1676}],\"excerpt\":\"## Two-Level Load Balancing (for SpMV on TCs)\\n术语是什么？\\nTwo-Level Load Balancing 是 Drawloom 为解决 SuiteSparse 数据集中稀疏矩阵行间 NNZ 分布不均导致的 GPU 线程负载不均衡而设计的两级负载均衡策略。(1) Matrix-level：根据 NNZ per row 用两个阈值 T1=(mma_m/V)×mma_k×WarpLoad 和 T2=mma_k 将矩阵行分为 Long/Medium/Short 三类，不同类采用不同 mapping 策略（Long独占TC block、Medium聚合、Short…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Signed Absolute Block Maximum Normalization（带符号绝对块最大值归一化 _ BOF4-S 归一化）.md\",\"basename\":\"Signed Absolute Block Maximum Normalization（带符号绝对块最大值归一化 _ BOF4-S 归一化）\",\"score\":260.76189134167674,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block-wise\",\"level\",\"level（0\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":19},{\"match\":\"Block\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"leve\",\"offset\":400},{\"match\":\"(bloc\",\"offset\":604},{\"match\":\"bloc\",\"offset\":649},{\"match\":\"ne le\",\"offset\":778},{\"match\":\"bs(bl\",\"offset\":831},{\"match\":\"= bl\",\"offset\":847},{\"match\":\"= bl\",\"offset\":899},{\"match\":\"ree l\",\"offset\":1006},{\"match\":\"假设 b\",\"offset\":1019},{\"match\":\"2 个 lev\",\"offset\":1251},{\"match\":\"在所有 b\",\"offset\":1348},{\"match\":\"ing Block-\",\"offset\":1408},{\"match\":\"bit Block-\",\"offset\":1445}],\"excerpt\":\"## Signed