knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Head-of-Line (HOL) Blocking in LLM Serving（LLM推理中的队首阻塞）.md\",\"basename\":\"Head-of-Line (HOL) Blocking in LLM Serving（LLM推理中的队首阻塞）\",\"score\":145.48022339522615,\"foundWords\":[\"blocking\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Blocking\",\"offset\":22},{\"match\":\"Blocking\",\"offset\":86},{\"match\":\"blocking\",\"offset\":175},{\"match\":\"blocking\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"blocking\",\"offset\":897},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1248},{\"match\":\"blocking\",\"offset\":1303},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1544},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1642},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1723},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1954}],\"excerpt\":\"## Head-of-Line (HOL) Blocking in LLM Serving（LLM推理中的队首阻塞）\\n术语是什么？\\nHead-of-Line (HOL) Blocking 原是网络交换中的经典排队现象——当队首数据包因目的地拥塞无法转发时，其后所有数据包被阻塞无法前进，即使它们的目的地空闲。在 LLM Serving 中，HOL blocking 指迭代级 FCFS 调度下，先到达的长序列 BE（Best-Effort）请求占据 batch 前排位置，导致后到达的 LS（Latency-Sensitive）请求被阻塞在整个完整 decode iteration（300-400ms for Mixtral 8×7B）之后…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Recompute-Decode Fused Kernel (K1+K2 Fusion).md\",\"basename\":\"Recompute-Decode Fused Kernel (K1+K2 Fusion)\",\"score\":137.16782562662308,\"foundWords\":[\"block\",\"block划分k1/k2——k1和k2使用独立的thread\",\"block划分k1\",\"block组，避免warp\",\"block组\",\"block数按计算量比分\",\"block分区**：不按warp而是按thread\",\"block分区\",\"block分配比例\",\"blockidx.x\",\"blockidx\",\"block级别动态分配。\",\"block级别动态分配\",\"block,\",\"block_id\",\"blocks\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":130},{\"match\":\"block级别动态分配。\",\"offset\":456},{\"match\":\"block数按计算量比分\",\"offset\":779},{\"match\":\"block,\",\"offset\":1859},{\"match\":\"block分配比例\",\"offset\":2409},{\"match\":\"block_id\",\"offset\":2626},{\"match\":\"blockIdx.x\",\"offset\":2637},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":2658},{\"match\":\"block_id\",\"offset\":2689},{\"match\":\"blocks\",\"offset\":2703},{\"match\":\"block\",\"offset\":2724},{\"match\":\"block_id\",\"offset\":2817},{\"match\":\"N个blo